message: "If you use SRVD or RIF, please cite the Zenodo records below."
type: book
title: "Structure Recursive Viability Dynamics (SRVD) v1.5 — Five-Volume Combined Edition"
abstract: "SRVD is a cross-scale, coarse-grained theoretical framework that treats crystals, living systems, AI models, civilizations and memes as persistent structures governed by one information-time-energy dynamics. Its core quantity is the viability potential V, with baseline V ≈ I·T/E and a general power-law form with ITE elasticity exponents. Its foundational axiom is that information exists only relative to a decoder (D → I → V). The edition includes a pre-registered list of ten falsifiable predictions with refutation conditions and a companion measurement framework (RIF). Status: theoretical framework; no independent empirical test completed."
